WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
10:00 — Sleeve photo. George photographs a sleeve on his phone and adds a condition note that will travel with the record, not live in his head.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
14:00 — iPad browse. Afternoon iPad browse through the collection feels like standing at the shelves without kneeling on the floor.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
19:00 — Laptop inventory. Laptop inventory for insurance — full list current, fictional values illustrative, no spreadsheet from 2011.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
20:00 — Wishlist pressings. Wishlist of pressings on the laptop; he wants fewer impulse buys and better notes when he finds one.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
20:30 — Phone end. Phone confirms today’s adds. The note finally travels with the sleeve.

